cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt these standards, please cite them as below. Documentation is CC BY 4.0; tooling is MIT."
title: "Gold Standard Guidelines: canonical engineering, design, data, AI and operational standards"
abstract: >-
  A public corpus of 117 engineering, design, data, AI, security, operations and process standards,
  each written to a fixed skeleton (Purpose, Rules, Anti-patterns, Checklist, Canonical summary,
  Sources) with normative MUST/SHOULD language. Includes machine-readable metadata (index.json),
  LLM entry points (llms.txt, llms-full.txt) and zero-dependency tooling for validation.
type: software
authors:
